No that's fine.  Actually the main way I'll need help is I'm going to
have a bunch of parts that need actors.  What i'll need people to do
is just record themselves reading their lines, and then we'll stitch
it together into dialogues, maybe with some sound effects and music in
the background.  I guess what i'm writing is a radio play.

The characters are various simple unmoving objects, like "xrula" and
"tricu" and "rokci", I guess it's like a forest scene but everything
can talk, and they're having a conversation that's at times
philosophical, at times whimsical, at times nonsensical.  It's almost
as if they're bored of being inanimate objects stuck in their tableau
scene, and have wild escapist imaginings.

